stream-matrix (2.1.4-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Replaced single-slot frame overwrites with bounded 6-frame adaptive PTS
    frame pacer in QmlAVPlayer.
  * Increased packet/frame queue headroom (VIDEO_PACKETS_LIMIT 160,
    AUDIO_PACKETS_LIMIT 64, VIDEO_FRAMES_LIMIT 24) and added zero-delay RTSP
    TCP demuxer options.
  * Added unobtrusive GitHub release update check in expanded sidebar header.
  * Preserved RTSP connections across video surface resets and handled
    transient AVERROR(EAGAIN) in demuxer/decoder loops.

 -- Justin Liedel <justinliedel@gmail.com>  Fri, 13 Nov 2026 12:00:00 -0500

stream-matrix (2.1.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Deferred AVFMT_FLAG_NOBUFFER until after avformat_find_stream_info() and
    lowered RTSP probing defaults (1.5s / 1 MB) for instant first-keyframe lock.
  * Immediate real-time RTSP socket teardown on EndOfMedia (AVERROR_EOF).
  * Reset demuxer interrupt timer before stream info probing; updated QML
    Connections handlers to Qt 5.15 function syntax.

 -- Justin Liedel <justinliedel@gmail.com>  Tue, 03 Nov 2026 12:00:00 -0500

stream-matrix (2.1.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * RTSP streaming efficiency and concurrency overhaul for Raspberry Pi 5 /
    SBCs: zero-allocation AVSmartPtr moves, lazy decoder thread creation,
    demuxer-level muted audio discard (AVDISCARD_ALL), automatic Pi 5 DRM
    hardware HEVC decoding, GUI frame coalescing, and staggered grid startup.
  * Added live real-time RTSP bitrate measurement in Diagnostics HUD.
  * Fixed interactive "Retry Now" button layering, avFormatCtx thread-safety
    race, decoder cleanup leaks, stale HUD metrics, and layout model leaks.

 -- Justin Liedel <justinliedel@gmail.com>  Mon, 26 Oct 2026 12:00:00 -0400

